<title>USA: Glimcher Realty names William Cornely CFO.</title>
<headline>Glimcher Realty names William Cornely CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glimcher Realty Trust said Wednesday that it has named William Cornely as chief financial officer and senior vice-president.</p>
<p>The company said he succeeds Terry Schreiner, who has resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>Cornely was previously a partner in the Columbus, Ohio office of Coopers &amp; Lybrand.</p>
<p>Glimcher is a REIT which owns and manages 113 properties in 24 states with 18.6 million square feet of gross leaseable release.</p>
</text>
